<p>Democracy Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by exploring the skills that help people participate in civic life, build connection, and work better together. <br><br>In this session, we’ll exercise our <strong>Opinion</strong><strong>&nbsp;Muscle:&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></strong><strong>In a democracy, you have the right to your own opinions. When we share them with each other, we discover how they take shape and can be challenged.</strong><br><br>Registration Recommended. Drop-ins welcome. <strong>Adults only.</strong><br><br><strong></strong>This program is offered in partnership with Democracy Fitness Global and MASS LBP.</p>
